"url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ig8.jpg"}, {"id": 1796830, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ify.jpg"}, {"id": 1796831, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ifz.jpg"}, {"id": 1796835, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ig3.jpg"}, {"id": 1796837, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ig5.jpg"}, {"id": 1796838, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ig6.jpg"}, {"id": 1796841, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12ig9.jpg"}], "slug": "cosmo-vulpes", "storyline": "Energy is something extremely valuable, a bounty hunter fox called Klaus together with his long time friend Safira are broke! Now they need explore the galaxy looking for missions and rewards to pay their bills, collecting Energy Gears and the Vultech Crystals, a powerful source of energy! Seems like a company who hires bounty-hunters announced a big reward for the bounty-hunter group who stays at the first of the rank at the end of the season, this is a big opportunity right? Combine Klaus' agility and skills with all the tools provided by the little fox, mainly the jetpack, while she do all the tech work and assistence!", "summary": "Inspired by 90's and 2000's 3D platformers, Cosmo Vulpes is a sci-fi adventure where your main tool is the jetpack. Play as bounty hunter fox called Klaus, with his jetpack and others gadgets developed by his friend Safira, a brilliant and skilled mechanic, you will help him to pass through challenges and missions on this adventure, earning money and collecting Vultechs, which are a big source of energy, but he is not the only one looking for them!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/cosmo-vulpes", "videos": [{"id": 129249, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "wEH6As8jp9w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wEH6As8jp9w", "title": "Cosmo Vulpes - SAGE 22 Teaser",